son Corporation.\nThe dispute has not heretofore been adjusted under the provisions of the  \nRailway Labor Act, as amended (“the Act”).\nA party em powered by the Act has requested that the President establish an \nemergency board pursuant to Section 9À of the Act.\nSection 9A(e) of the Act provides that the President, upon such a request, shall \nappoint an emergency board to investigate and report on the dispute.\nNOW, THEREFORE, by the authority vested in me by Section 9A of the Act, \nas am ended (45 U.S.C. § 159a), it","path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/texts/EO_12495.txt","sha256":"29e7c14926ece95bb9d657c68c706d805122377c298b483386cce15d17100c5d","source":{"line":1828,"path":"jobs/fr-originals/output/SOURCES.jsonl","record_sha256":"504277507f2f4617ceeeadb39a90e820a03d53015ef7d5de2d978be52c86c6c1"}}]}
